&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Working Environment&lt;/strong&gt;: Flexibility to work from home and in the office, with most team members in the office two days a week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pet-Friendly Office&lt;/strong&gt;: If you’re near one of our offices, bring your furry friend along!&lt;/li&gt;
